= August Frölich

August Frölich is a Thuringian member of our party. He is a left-winger but definetly capable of compromise if the situation nececitates it.

- @thur_works: Speed up work in the Thuringian government
- @appeal_to_logic: Appeal to logic
- @negotiate_left: Negotiate woth the Left
- @root: Return to main

@thur_works
subtitle: Frölich is part of the government in Thuringia.
choose-if: thuringia_spd == 1 and advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if not thuringia_spd == 1: Frölich is not part of the government in Thuringia. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: thuringia_action_timer -= 8; advisor_action_timer = 6

Things are getting done faster.

@appeal_to_logic
subtitle: Tell the our left-wing that they have to wait for the circumstances to turn in our favour.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 8; center_dissent -= 1; labor_dissent -= 1
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] 

We will have our class war when the time is ripe.

@negotiate_left
subtitle: Frölich is one of the most respected SPD members in the other worker's parties.
on-arrival: uspd_relation += 6; sb_relation += 5; kapd_relation += 1; kpd_relation += 3; sapd_relation += 5; advisor_action_timer = 6
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] 

The other parties consider his points.
